# Optional. When set, "I'm interested" POSTs {to, text} as JSON to this URL and the
# message is sent without the visitor tapping anything. Leave it unset and the
# button instead opens the visitor's own SMS app with the text prefilled.
#
# This must be a write-only endpoint, never a provider API key: NEXT_PUBLIC_ values
# are inlined into the JavaScript bundle at build time and are readable by anyone.
#
# Zapier: create a Zap with "Webhooks by Zapier -> Catch Hook" as the trigger and an
# SMS action as the step, then paste the Catch Hook URL here.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SMS_WEBHOOK=https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/000000/abcdef/
